  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **How To Embrace A Swamp Creature**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Distant Stations**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Horshradish Road**: back after 36 archived shows (734 days); rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **TMG2018-04-21** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 109 min [1]\n- **tmg2018-04-21.theMountainGoats_UpstateConcertHall_4.21.18**: source not stated; 0 songs; 112 min [2]. Said about its sound: Recording was paused for about a second during the Black Pear Tree section, leaving a small flaw [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Horshradish Road, How To Embrace A Swamp Creature, Night Light, The Mountain Goats Return Liza Forever Minnelli, This Year, Unicorn Tolerance, Wear Black [1]\n- Taper was in the second row [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **TMG2018-04-21**: taped by torbar; source: Google Pixel [1]. Also: Recorded with a Google Pixel phone kept in a pants pocket [1]\n- **tmg2018-04-21.theMountainGoats_UpstateConcertHall_4.21.18**: taped by natsinator; source: Samsung Galaxy s6 [2]. Also: Recorded on a Samsung Galaxy S6 held in hand, very close to the front; Setlist was copied from another recording of this show, made by torbar [2]",
